## Data
The single-cell RNA-seq data (.h5 files) are available from Zenodo
(https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18308840). The record is currently under
restricted access and will be made publicly available upon acceptance
of the manuscript.

## How to run
Place the 12 .h5 files in the working directory, install the required
packages in advance, and run the scripts in `Figure_source` in order
(1 → 2 → 3 → 4) within a single R session; objects are passed between
scripts in memory. Outputs are written to `results/`
(`objects/`, `tables/`, and `figures/`).

